mysqlnd with OpenSSL: the module mysqlnd of php82-mysqlnd built with its
extended SSL (MYSQLND_HAVE_SSL), linked with the OpenSSL of the base
system: the logins caching_sha2_password (the default of MySQL 8 and
later) and sha256_password. The same files as php82-mysqlnd: install one
of the two; php82-mysqli-openssl, php82-pdo_mysql-openssl and
php82-openswoole-openssl go with it.

The module mysqlnd of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20220829/mysqlnd.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d, its
headers in include/php82/php/ext/mysqlnd.
